msgctxt "xmas99/02_xmas2"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Michelle:\n"
"You've changed my life in so many ways\n"
"I dedicate this project to you.\n"
"I love you so much."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Michelle:\n"
"Je hebt mijn leven op zoveel manieren veranderd.\n"
"Ik draag dit project aan jou op.\n"
"Ik hou zó veel van je."

